  "description": "Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 33 Cliona Park to the Limerick sales market.\nThis is a 3 bedroom home which boasts much added space such as an extended living area and fantastic open plan kitchen living area.\nAs you enter no. 33 you are welcomed by a hallway.  Off the hallway is the living room.\nThe kitchen was fitted in recent years, is very well appointed and it seamlessly links with the dining/living area which has added great space to the house. This is a bright room is a very relaxing place in the home to unwind.   Additionally, on the ground floor there is a very convenient Utility and WC.\nFocusing on upstairs, there are 3 bedrooms, 2 of which accommodate double beds and 1 room is a single. Completing the accommodation is the master bathroom.\nOutside, there is parking for up to 2 cars on the driveway and to the rear of the home is a secure generous size garden.\nWindows in the home are double glazed and the main heating system is gas. \nFor more information and to arrange a viewing please call Rachael or simply reply to this daft advert.\nDisclaimer: These particulars and terms are provided by Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers with the understanding that all negotiations regarding the mentioned property must be conducted exclusively through them. While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information provided, Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the particulars or any representations made about the property. The details in this brochure do not form any part of a contract. Prospective purchasers or lessees are advised to independently verify all details to their satisfaction. Rowan Fitzgerald Auctioneers shall not be held responsible for any loss or expenses incurred in visiting the property, including but not limited to instances where the property is found to be unsuitable, already sold, let, or withdrawn from the market.\n",
